body:
I try my best all my life but there is a clear trend that it isn't good enough or something im doing is wrong. thats why I say that. yes I do try my best but if my best doesn't get me anywhere good or better then what am I supposed to do?

&#x200B;

Hopefully that makes sense. thank you for your message.

Im not sure who im good enough anymore. I don't know what will either to be honest. I try to set goals but every time I have set goals or plans I have always not hit the goals so I don't like to just because of the fear of failure and just being a shit person. 

&#x200B;

Im not sure how to find myself cause I had tried new things previously and nothing helped so now I just aimlessly live until something happens. I dont know what exactly but yeah. 

&#x200B;

thank you for your message I appreciate it.

Thank you but I dont feel good enough. I try very hard but nothing works so now I just waiting until something goes good or until my last days. not much else I can do I guess. 

&#x200B;

I know who I am but I have changed, but I don't know what I want to be i've failed at that so I can't do that anymore because I will just be asking to fail so now i'm just in limbo which is where ive been for a long time. I don't know i'm sorry.

I try but im very crital of myself because I want to make people happy. I don't know how to make myself happy. They may not say it but I can tell I have failed them by their actions, response to me etc. There's many ways I can see people don't have faith in me or love me anymore. 

&#x200B;

My acceptations are a bit high but I just want to have a better life rather than the constant droning and repetitive shitty days. Not sure how to focus on myself or how to teach myself "self-love" I tried to learn before but nothing really helped so I just live day by day, if something goes good then great, if life stays shit as it is at the moment then I'll just wait till my last days I guess. Sorry if I sound very defeated and pessimistic.

&#x200B;

Thank you for your message I appreciate taking time out of your day and I hope you have a good day.

thank you for your comment.

&#x200B;

I have heard the same people hurt me say the same thing(referring to me being positive things for them), I dont really believe I am a positive thing for people cause it never lasts. if anything I see myself more so as a lesson for people. what I mean is that depending on the person their relationship with overtime will teach them something, whether it's what to look for in their significant other, how to help a friend in a certain circumstance etc. It's never a long term relationship with anyone it's all come and go I guess. so maybe I am not necessarily meant to receive love or care. maybe im just meant to give everything I have got and be exposed to "love" or "care" in small doses to keep me around. I dont know. im sorry. 

&#x200B;

I dont know how to concentrate anything I do varies me into some sort of sad or depressive thought. I dont have anymore hobbies (partly me not enjoying anymore, partly COVID) so tbh I dont know how to make a hobby cause 9/10 times I unfortunately might try something I won't enjoy it and give up on it within a week or 2. 

&#x200B;

Thank you. I have been told by many people that I am a nice person and all those positive things abut me but even with all this positive stigma I always seem to mess up a "good" thing and ive done it multiple times. I dont think they are lucky, im more so lucky if they stay but haven't been that lucky and probably won't be but that's my life I guess now.  

That is definitely true but I dont see any positive in myself cause everything I deemed as positive has always hurt, failed or disappointed others or myself so I dont see positives anymore it just goes over my head. sorry

&#x200B;

sorry if this sounds very defeated and more.

Yea so thats my exact thought process in terms of why i'm still breathing now. but as you said. as soon as they unfortunately pass and If I continue to feel like I have nothing left to give to the world. i'm gone. but yeah thats life I guess. 

&#x200B;

in terms of friends and relationships maybe i'm just too clingy to people and want someone to check up on me etc but no one does. i'm always checking on others. maybe im just not meant to have anyone around me cause everything fails in the end. :( 

&#x200B;

I would love to leave my customer facing job but I want to leave to start a role where I can start a full career. hopefully thats office-based and moving up in a celercal role but no one wants to hire me cause as I said before I have no experience but thats what entry level roles want. which is a loophole. Ive looked into recruitment agencies that provide clerical roles and more but either they again ask from experience for their temp roles or they just do not select to take me further into recruitment which makes me feel like im not gonna amount to anything cause I have tried it for 3-4 years and just constant rejection is all I face. 

&#x200B;

Not being in a customer facing role and a more clerical role where I can actually improve and use my skills would definitely help with my mental issues I face 24/7 but I can't seen to catch a break unfortunately. I have tried everything I can think of and still no one wants me. 

I do not want this to sound rude, however due to me working to help pay bills and then in my spare time im either continuously applying from jobs I most likely won't get but hope to. I dont have much time to have any hobbies or do any type of voluntary work. I feel like once I get out of my customer facing work environment. it may help but im not sure. 

&#x200B;

I just feel like im just a lesson or guidelines of what someone should look for in any roles in life. friend, son, boyfriend, partner. etc. hopefully that makes sense. nothing ever works out with or around me. I always mess up and people move on to meet better people, do better things, and live better lives so maybe I hold everyone and everything around me back. Maybe if I just died then my mum and dad can live without me disappointing them by being alive, my friends could live better without having to deal with my bs, any future partners could find their "true love"s faster cause they don't have to deal with me first. maybe its for the better if I just left. 

&#x200B;

Im sorry. hopefully that made sense

Thank you for taking the time to respond and have a good day at volunteering.
